{% set meetings = meetings | upcoming %}
{% include "templates/header.njk" %}
  <script type="application/ld+json">{% eventsJsonLd meetings, "en", page.url, site.url %}</script>

  <main class="container">
    <h1 id="welcome">{{ title }}</h1>
      <p>
        Welcome to the WHIP BDSM community in Leipzig — glad you’re here!<br/>
        We want to offer a safer space where you can connect with like-minded people about BDSM and open up, without things getting too intense or uncomfortable.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>We are not a dating platform or a matchmaking service.</strong>
      </p>
      <p>
        Here you can learn more about our <a href="/en/concept.html">concept</a>, our <a href="/en/principles.html">principles</a>, and pretty much everything else in the <a href="/en/faq.html">FAQ</a>.
      </p>
    {{content | safe}}
    <aside>
      <strong>Please note:</strong> Our community is primarily German-speaking and we don’t offer English-only meetups at the moment. That said, quite a few of our members enjoy speaking English and we’d be happy to welcome you even if you don’t speak German at all!
    </aside>
    <h2>Upcoming dates</h2>
    {% if meetings.length %}
    <ul>
      {% for meeting in meetings %}
        <li>
          {% switch meeting.type %}
            {% case "meeting" %}
              <a href="/en/faq.html#what-kinds-of-meetups-are-there-at-whip">WHIP meetup</a>:
            {% case "play" %}
              <a href="/en/faq.html#what-kinds-of-meetups-are-there-at-whip">Play-WHIP</a>:
          {% endswitch %}
            {% meetingDate meeting.date, 'en' %}
          {% if meeting.topic %}
          <br />
          Topic: "{{ meeting.topic }}"
          {% endif %}
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% else %}
    <p>New dates coming soon.</p>
    {% endif %}
    <section class="cta">
      <p><strong>Want to come by?</strong> Lovely! Please take a quick look at how to get in touch with us first – it makes getting started easy.</p>
      <a href="/en/faq.html#how-do-i-reach-the-organizers-how-can-i-contact-you" role="button" class="outline">How to get in touch</a>
    </section>
    <aside>
      <h3>Tips:</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Is something not okay for you? <a href="/en/faq.html#what-if-someone-crosses-my-boundaries">Here's what you can do.</a></li>
        <li>With <a href="/{{ calendar.permalink }}">our calendar subscription</a> you'll always know about new dates – or add <code>{{ site.url }}/{{ calendar.permalink }}</code> to the calendar of your choice.</li>
        <li>We also developed a consent creation tool named "Kinkburst", <a href="{{ site.kinkburst }}">which you can find here</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </main>

{% include "templates/footer.njk" %}
